$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Copper(I) 3-Methylsalicylate Mediates the Chan-Lam N-Arylation of
Heterocycles
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Farahat, Abdelbasset A.; Boykin, David W.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Synthetic Communications (2015), 45(2), 245-252

